From 4cefc2f78c76f9cfb4813d616aaff31107bd1940 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 23 Aug 2026 15:08:15 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] proof: P0-5 listing deletion retention - migration 0008 plus
 media reclamation

- 0008_detach_listing_evidence: conversations, bookings, reports and lead_history
  move from ON DELETE CASCADE to ON DELETE SET NULL and become nullable.
  listing_media deliberately stays CASCADE - the contract requires those rows gone.
- deleteListing reads media identities before the delete, then hands them to
  objectStorageService.deleteServingUrls after the DB delete commits, best-effort
  and never rolling the delete back
- Gate 4 acceptance test copied in byte-identical from its branch: 6/6 pass
